01:00:14.580 --> 01:00:15.520
makes a mistake

01:00:15.520 --> 01:00:17.160
he has to bring a Korban

01:00:17.160 --> 01:00:19.980
what happens if Edina makes a mistake

01:00:19.980 --> 01:00:21.240
he brings a Korban

01:00:21.240 --> 01:00:23.600
what happens if the Kohanim make a mistake

01:00:23.600 --> 01:00:26.040
what is the purpose of the Korban

01:00:26.040 --> 01:00:28.060
to admit

01:00:28.060 --> 01:00:29.780
we made a mistake

01:00:29.780 --> 01:00:32.240
we are not above the law

01:00:32.240 --> 01:00:35.140
alright

01:00:35.140 --> 01:00:38.000
what happens in America

01:00:38.000 --> 01:00:39.540
if a president makes a mistake.

01:00:39.700 --> 01:00:40.440
He gets reelected.

01:00:40.520 --> 01:00:41.880
He gets reelected, exactly.

01:00:43.680 --> 01:00:45.840
And you say, how about there is no

01:00:45.840 --> 01:00:47.560
I cannot run for third term.

01:00:48.680 --> 01:00:51.540
So what time I begin to

01:00:51.540 --> 01:00:52.600
with the other class?

01:00:52.840 --> 01:00:54.560
What did we do last time, 10.30?

01:00:57.260 --> 01:00:57.740
Yes?

01:00:57.880 --> 01:00:58.520
Is everybody here?

01:00:58.600 --> 01:01:00.900
Can you count it for on the Talmud side?

01:01:01.520 --> 01:01:01.800
Yeah.

01:01:01.800 --> 01:01:04.740
I have to

01:01:04.740 --> 01:01:06.860
I need to rest at least

01:01:06.860 --> 01:01:07.580
three minutes.

01:01:08.000 --> 01:01:09.000
Okay.

01:01:09.000 --> 01:01:10.000
All right?

01:01:10.000 --> 01:01:15.000
So shall we call for Rabbi Hananiah?

01:01:38.000 --> 01:01:40.000
Amen.

01:02:08.000 --> 01:02:19.320
Give me about five minutes.

01:02:19.320 --> 01:02:19.820
Yes?

01:02:20.020 --> 01:02:20.320
And then...

01:02:21.040 --> 01:02:23.680
Yeah.

01:02:23.920 --> 01:02:24.060
Yeah?

01:02:24.180 --> 01:02:24.520
Yeah.

01:02:24.520 --> 01:02:24.780
Is that all right?

01:02:25.140 --> 01:02:25.420
Yeah.

01:02:26.220 --> 01:02:27.040
What sticks?

